  "description": "Upwards DCA...compounding our winners",
  "body_html": "<p>Good morning and happy Monday. Just a very quick note about which stock I think we will be dollar cost averaging <em><strong>up</strong></em> ⬆️ next, as a heads up to you. Performance wise, we are off to a great 2026. How long it lasts? Who knows…enjoy the ride for as long as possible!</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ridg!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84536424-7d41-4ab8-9e88-49138d2a98f8_329x139.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ridg!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84536424-7d41-4ab8-9e88-49138d2a98f8_329x139.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ridg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84536424-7d41-4ab8-9e88-49138d2a98f8_329x139.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ridg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84536424-7d41-4ab8-9e88-49138d2a98f8_329x139.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ridg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84536424-7d41-4ab8-9e88-49138d2a98f8_329x139.png\" width=\"329\" height=\"139\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/84536424-7d41-4ab8-9e88-49138d2a98f8_329x139.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:139,&quot;width&quot;:329,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null